### End-to-end flow across the 11 features (run the requests in order).
### Recycler → route → collection point → collection → material → rate → plant → lot
### → weighing (adds stock) → sale (removes stock) → settlement (amount from weighings × rate) → approve → pay.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002

### 1. Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### 2. Recycler
# @name recycler
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/recyclers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Reciclador E2E {{$timestamp}}",
  "documentNumber": "E2E-{{$timestamp}}",
  "phone": "3001112233"
}

### 3. Route
# @name route
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/routes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ruta E2E {{$timestamp}}",
  "municipality": "Riohacha"
}

### 4. Collection point on the route
# @name point
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/collection-points
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Punto E2E {{$timestamp}}",
  "routeId": {{route.response.body.$.route.id}},
  "address": "Calle 1 # 2-3, Riohacha"
}

### 5. Collection (workday) of the recycler on the route — date defaults to today
# @name collection
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/collections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jornada E2E {{$timestamp}}",
  "recyclerId": {{recycler.response.body.$.recycler.id}},
  "routeId": {{route.response.body.$.route.id}}
}

### 6. Material
# @name material
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/materials
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Material E2E {{$timestamp}}"
}

### 7. Rate of the material (valid from today)
# @name rate
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/material-rates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tarifa E2E",
  "materialId": {{material.response.body.$.material.id}},
  "pricePerKg": 1000
}

### 8. Plant
# @name plant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/plants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Planta E2E {{$timestamp}}",
  "municipality": "Riohacha"
}

### 9. Lot of the material at the plant (starts empty)
# @name lot
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/material-lots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "LT-E2E-{{$timestamp}}",
  "plantId": {{plant.response.body.$.plant.id}},
  "materialId": {{material.response.body.$.material.id}}
}

### 10. Weighing into the lot: net = 120.5 − 2.5 = 118 kg → lot stock 118
# @name weighing
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/weighings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pesaje E2E",
  "collectionId": {{collection.response.body.$.collection.id}},
  "materialId": {{material.response.body.$.material.id}},
  "materialLotId": {{lot.response.body.$.materialLot.id}},
  "grossWeightKg": 120.5,
  "tareWeightKg": 2.5
}

### 11. Sale from the lot: 50 kg × 1500 = 75000 → lot stock 68
# @name sale
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/material-sales
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Venta E2E",
  "buyerName": "Transformadora E2E S.A.S.",
  "materialLotId": {{lot.response.body.$.materialLot.id}},
  "quantityKg": 50,
  "unitPricePerKg": 1500
}

### 12. Lot stock (expects weightKg 68)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/material-lots/{{lot.response.body.$.materialLot.id}}

### 13. Settlement of the recycler for today: 118 kg × 1000 = 118000 (pending)
# @name settlement
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/settlements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recyclerId": {{recycler.response.body.$.recycler.id}},
  "periodStart": "{{collection.response.body.$.collection.collectionDate}}",
  "periodEnd": "{{collection.response.body.$.collection.collectionDate}}"
}

### 14. Approve
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/settlements/{{settlement.response.body.$.settlement.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "state": "approved"
}

### 15. Pay
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/settlements/{{settlement.response.body.$.settlement.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "state": "paid"
}

### 16. Global JSON errors: unknown route (404) and malformed JSON (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/no-existe

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/recyclers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "sin cerrar"
